@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Step Execution
actor Frontend
participant "Simulator Client" as Client
participant "WebSocketServer" as WS
participant Simulator
participant "SIC/XE Architecture" as Architecture
participant Registers
participant "Memory Accessor" as MemoryAccessor
participant Memory
participant "Instruction Source Map" as SourceMap
participant "Event Manager" as Events

Frontend -> Client : step()
Client -> WS : {id, type:"step"}
WS -> Simulator : step()

Simulator -> Registers : read(PC)
Registers --> Simulator : PC

Simulator -> Architecture : step()
Architecture -> Registers : read(PC)
Registers --> Architecture : PC
Architecture -> SourceMap : lookup instruction address PC
SourceMap --> Architecture : 1-based source line (if mapped)
Architecture -> MemoryAccessor : fetch(PC, size, source line, preview=false)
MemoryAccessor -> Memory : read(PC, size)
Memory --> MemoryAccessor : instruction bytes
MemoryAccessor -> Events : commit InstructionFetched(address, bytes, source_line?)
MemoryAccessor --> Architecture : instruction bytes

Architecture -> Registers : read/write registers
Architecture -> Memory : read/write memory

Architecture -> Registers : read(PC) after execution
Registers --> Architecture : next PC
Architecture -> SourceMap : lookup instruction address next PC
SourceMap --> Architecture : 1-based source line (if mapped)
Architecture -> MemoryAccessor : fetch(next PC, size, source line, preview=true)
MemoryAccessor -> Memory : read(next PC, size)
Memory --> MemoryAccessor : next instruction bytes
MemoryAccessor -> Events : commit preview InstructionFetched

Architecture --> Simulator : instruction step complete
Simulator -> Events : read events since step start

Simulator --> WS : {id, result: events}
WS --> Client : response
Client --> Frontend : resolve(events)
Frontend -> Frontend : map source_line to active Monaco model
Frontend -> Frontend : animate real fetch as executed instruction
Frontend -> Frontend : map final fetch source_line to active Monaco model
Frontend -> Frontend : show debugger arrow on next instruction

note right of SourceMap
Built by the assembler from emitted
instruction address and source line.
Raw hex images have no source map.
end note

@enduml
